%% Modulo 29 - POST /api/v1/qa/campaigns/{campaign}/executions
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor QA as Analista QA
    participant MW as tenant + JWT + permiso
    participant CTRL as QaRegressionController
    participant APP as ManageQaRegression
    participant REPO as QaRegressionRepository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL HOSPITAL

    QA->>MW: POST /api/v1/qa/campaigns/{campaign}/executions
    MW->>MW: Validar tenant, jwt.auth y qa.regression.manage
    MW->>CTRL: Payload validado por RecordExecutionRequest
    CTRL->>APP: recordExecution(RecordExecutionCommand)
    APP->>APP: Autorizar usuario y hospital
    APP->>REPO: findCampaign(campaign, hospitalId)
    REPO->>DB: Buscar campana y casos por hospital_id
    DB-->>REPO: RegressionCampaign
    REPO-->>APP: Campana con testCaseIds
    APP->>APP: Verificar test_case_id asociado
    APP->>APP: Crear Evidence y TestExecution

    alt status es FAILED
        APP->>APP: Validar reproduction_steps, severity y detected_version
        APP->>APP: Defect.fromFailedExecution() con estado OPEN
        APP->>REPO: recordExecution(execution, defect)
        REPO->>DB: BEGIN
        REPO->>DB: INSERT qa_defects
        REPO->>DB: INSERT qa_test_executions
        REPO->>DB: INSERT qa_evidences
        REPO->>DB: COMMIT
        DB-->>REPO: Ejecucion, evidencia y defecto confirmados
        REPO-->>APP: Operacion completada
        APP-->>CTRL: execution + defect
    else status es PASSED o BLOCKED
        APP->>REPO: recordExecution(execution, null)
        REPO->>DB: BEGIN
        REPO->>DB: INSERT qa_test_executions
        REPO->>DB: INSERT qa_evidences
        REPO->>DB: COMMIT
        DB-->>REPO: Ejecucion y evidencia confirmadas
        REPO-->>APP: Operacion completada
        APP-->>CTRL: execution + defect null
    end

    CTRL-->>QA: 201 Created
    Note over APP,DB: La evidencia es una referencia validada, no se abre ni se recalcula su hash
    Note over APP,DB: CENTRAL no participa en la transaccion HOSPITAL-local
